{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995800/extras/98ec59df29a35c42538e8c8b75d9e690.avif?t=1758390732\" width=870 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>The Story So Far...</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Hunter, a <strong>Novice of the Mage Order</strong>, an ancestral organization tasked with policing the usage of magic, particularly during the First Kingdoms\u2019 War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now is a time of peace. The Order works as private militia, maintaining law and order, both on land and at sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You operate in the <strong>DrakkenRidge archipelago</strong>, a string of islands under the authority of the Duchy of <strong>Eaglemoore</strong>, located on <strong>Drakken Isle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995800/extras/41e88bb0412f5a1a00097cb3786ce6ce.avif?t=1758390732\" width=870 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Core GamePlay</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the Fate of DrakkenRidge by fulfilling the <strong>main quest</strong> and a trove of <strong>side-quests</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>multiple islands and dungeons</strong>, solve puzzles and defeat enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast spells</strong> using ancient runes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use melee weapons</strong> (swords, axes, maces, daggers).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>bows and arrows</strong> or <strong>black powder guns</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong> or upgrade your equipment using the various workbenches in your Hunter\u2019s lodge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new schools of magic by <strong>acquiring essences</strong> from Bosses and fallen enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995800/extras/9e4c00823690f23b8fb25a5c59e41d70.avif?t=1758390732\" width=870 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Various Biomes &amp; Dungeons</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skull Island</strong> [ Dungeon: Smugglers Cove]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drakken Isle</strong> [ Dungeons: Royal Sewers &amp; Smugglers Island ]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R'Sunkun</strong> [ Dungeons: A'Tleh &amp; F'Arak ]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Madak Dwvir</strong> [ Dungeons: The Great Forge &amp; Undermountain ]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loreley</strong> [ Dungeons: The Cathedral Of Light &amp; The Tree Of Life ]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More To Come...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995800/extras/981aac0df20d20072edc92b2d27bb39f.avif?t=1758390732\" width=870 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995800?t=1758390732","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995800/147818b1b210791777be0193773bc52298e0aee4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758390732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995800/c491cee0b99b518406e0dc52d611b23b18e93189/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758390732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995800/c491cee0